@bank all
// SW3 (2026-10-26, Pillar 5 Step 5, S5-7 words; plans/p5-step5-spec.html on claude/p5-specs, "The beats" and section 10):
// the Senior Officer promotion's texts, for 24u's worksText (S5-2). Said by nobody unless noted. Mirrors the first
// promotion's pb.* keys (content/works/promo-beats.lines), with pu3. in front. Calder speaks the "say" keys: exact,
// numbers not adjectives, never "well done", no "!". Mails are "Subject | body", unsigned (the game adds the sender).
// {day}: "tomorrow" or a weekday; {time}: a time like 08:15; {name}: a crew member's name. Each beat fires once.
// The scenes are meetings (content/meetings/pu3.*.meet); the people's own words are kind `work` under flags in their
// own lines (calder, torres-zeke, halloran-emeka, tomas, brennan); the crew's chatter is content/banks/promo-t3.lines.

// ---- nearly there: the toast when your reputation word changes at Tier 2 (Officer) ----
== works.rep.up2.trusted
- Now Trusted. One more step, Relied on, and you're up for your Tier 3 test.
== works.rep.up2.relied
- Now Relied on. That's the reputation your Tier 3 test needs.

// ---- the offer (Calder in person first: meeting pu3.offer, .monday or .party; then these) ----
// the urgent notice ({day}: "tomorrow" or "Monday")
== pu3.offer.notice
- Your Tier 3 test: {day}, 09:00, the job board in the Works bay.
// the Mail, the record of what she said
== mail.pu3.offer
- Your Tier 3 test | As I said: {day}, 09:00, Works bay. A Deck 6 junction, switched off and back on, properly. Pass it and you're a Senior Officer.
// if she couldn't find you in person by 22:00 (you were asleep, or nowhere near), the Mail says it all
== mail.pu3.offer.late
- Your Tier 3 test | I came to find you. Relied on, and Power safety done: that's all of it. Your Tier 3 test is {day}, 09:00, Works bay. Sleep.
// the Record's "What's next" while you're below Relied on as an Officer ({band}: your word now)
== next.t3.steps
- Your Tier 3 test needs Relied on and Power safety. You're {band} now.

// ---- the Works app's Training tab, "Your promotion" checklist for Tier 3 ----
== pu3.check.title
- Your promotion: the Tier 3 test
== pu3.check.day
- The test from Day 15
== pu3.check.rep
- Relied on (you're {band})
== pu3.check.ps
- Power safety, with the Chief
== pu3.check.set
- Test job: {day}, 09:00
== pu3.check.result
- Your result: {day}, 08:15
== pu3.check.bar
- Your bar, from the Captain
== pu3.check.toast
- The Captain's toast
== pu3.check.done
- Done
== pu3.check.not
- Not yet

// ---- the Schedule's and Tracked's rows ----
== pu3.row.test
- Your Tier 3 test
== pu3.row.result
- Your result, 08:15
== pu3.row.bar
- The Captain, {time}
== pu3.row.toast
- The toast, 19:00

// ---- before: up to two friends' Mail at 20:00 the evening before (one each, in order) ----
== mail.pu3.luck
- Tomorrow | You came through the storm. A junction is a box with a switch on it. You'll be fine. Bed early, though.
- Good luck | Tier 3 tomorrow. I'm not worried, so you shouldn't be. Proper breakfast. That's from a friend, and it's an order.

// ---- the test morning ----
// once you're up (a device notice)
== pu3.morning.notice
- Today: your Tier 3 test, 09:00. It goes up on the job board in the Works bay.
// Calder as you come into the bay (her own lines under flag pu3.promo.morning come first)
== pu3.morning.say
- Nine o'clock. Take it when you're ready.
// the board's gold ring on the test's Take it (forced, whatever Teaching arrows says)
== pu3.ptr.test
- Your Tier 3 test: take it

// ---- the test: the ring line at each step ({name}: the person to warn) ----
== pu3.ptr.plan
- Your Tier 3 test: plan it with Calder
== pu3.ptr.warn
- Warn {name} about the shutdown
== pu3.ptr.off
- Switch it off
== pu3.ptr.breaker
- Change the breaker
== pu3.ptr.back
- Bring it back
== pu3.ptr.turnin
- Turn it in
// the talk option on a person you have to warn
== pu3.warn.ask
- About the shutdown
// the toast when you've warned someone ({name}), and when Calder tells the one you couldn't find
== pu3.warn.done
- {name} knows. Thank you.
== pu3.warn.calder
- Calder told {name} for you. One less to find.
// holding another job while the test waits on the board (a notice, once an hour; {time}: when the test comes off)
== pu3.busy.notice
- Your Tier 3 test waits on the job board till {time}. Turn in or drop this job first.
// not taken by 15:00, or dropped: never failed, set again ({day}: the new day)
== pu3.again.notice
- Your Tier 3 test is set again: {day}, 09:00, the Works bay.
== mail.pu3.again
- Again | Not today. Practise your shutdowns: warn first, check it's dead, then touch it. We go again {day}, 09:00.

// ---- passing (her word there is train.t3.done; these after it) ----
== pu3.passed.say
- That's the test. Your result {day}, first thing. My office, {time}. Don't be early.
== mail.pu3.passed
- Your test | Done. Your result {day}, {time}, my office. Not before. I won't have had my tea.
== pu3.passed.notice
- Your Tier 3 test is done. Your result: {day}, {time}, the Chief's office.

// ---- the result day ----
// the Mail at 06:00 ({time}: 08:15)
== mail.pu3.result
- Your result | My office, {time}. Before your shift. Sit down when you come in. That's new.
// the urgent notice once you're up
== pu3.result.notice
- Your Tier 3 result: {time}, the Chief's office, Works bay. Before your shift.
// the ring on her office door and the arrow's label
== pu3.ptr.result
- Your result: Calder's office
// her words by Mail if you never came (by 09:15)
== mail.pu3.promo
- Your result | You weren't about, so you'll read it. You passed. As of today you're a Senior Officer: Senior Technician, Tier 3. Your card is on my desk. The Captain pins your bar this afternoon, observation room. Clean uniform.

// ---- the bar ----
// the Captain's invite, that morning ({time}: 16:30, or 17:15 on a Friday)
== mail.pu3.invite
- Your bar, {time} | Chief Calder tells me you've passed. Today at {time}, the observation room, Deck 1, I'd like to pin your bar myself. Bring your friends. There will be cake; I'm told that's not my decision.
// the notice 30 minutes before
== pu3.bar.notice
- The Captain pins your bar at {time}: the observation room, Deck 1. Go now.
// Calder in the bay as it nears (her own lines under flag pu3.promo.bar come first)
== pu3.bar.say
- Go.
// the arrow's and the ring's label
== pu3.ptr.bar
- Your bar: the observation room
// the ceremony by Mail, if you never came (by 22:00)
== mail.pu3.bar
- Your bar | We missed you this afternoon. The bar is on your cabin shelf with the certificate. Come up to the observation room one evening and I'll pin it properly. Congratulations, Senior Officer.
// the framed certificate on your cabin shelf (its name; and its text, if the game shows it)
== pu3.keepsake
- Senior Officer's certificate
== pu3.keepsake.text
- Senior Officer, Senior Technician. A storm, a test and a ship that noticed. O. Marrow
// the Record's milestone ({n}: the day number)
== works.ms.senior
- Senior Officer, Day {n}
// the Ship app's news (one gossip line; {me})
== pu3.news
- {me} is a Senior Officer as of today. The bar, the observation room, and cake.

// ---- the cake ----
// the ring on Brennan
== pu3.ptr.cake
- Take a slice
// the toast when you take it
== pu3.cake.toast
- A slice of Brennan's cake. Still warm.

// ---- the toast ----
// the Captain's invite that morning
== mail.pu3.toast
- The toast | Tonight, 19:00, my quarters, Deck 2. Dinner, and a toast to our new Senior Officer. Commander Vance will be there, on his day off; please thank him for it, he'll enjoy refusing the thanks.
// the notice at 18:30, and the arrow's label
== pu3.toast.notice
- The Captain's toast at 19:00: her quarters, Deck 2. Go at quarter to.
== pu3.ptr.toast
- The Captain's toast: her quarters
// the framed menu on your cabin shelf (its name; its text)
== pu3.menu
- The Captain's menu
== pu3.menu.text
- Soup from the garden. Brennan's pie. Custard. One toast: to the new Senior Officer.
// by Mail if you missed it
== mail.pu3.toast.missed
- Tonight | We kept your chair. The toast was drunk anyway: I'm told that's allowed. The menu is on your shelf. Next time, come hungry.

// ---- after: What's next, and the Training tab line ----
== next.pu3.result
- Your result: {day}, 08:15, the Chief's office.
== next.pu3.bar
- The Captain pins your bar at {time}, the observation room, Deck 1.
== next.pu3.toast
- The Captain's toast at 19:00, her quarters, Deck 2.
== works.pu3.home
- You stay in cabin 4-23 as a Senior Officer. Your laundry stays yours to do.

// ---- Power safety (ps, S5-1 turn 2; the lesson is meeting train.ps.calder) ----
== works.mech.ps
- Power safety
// the ask (toast and Mail; {time} and {place} filled by the game; never a time by hand)
== works.ask.ps
- Power safety | Before any Tier 3 work: Power safety, with me. Twenty minutes. You watch. {time}, {place}.
== next.ps
- Power safety comes next: a short lesson with the Chief at a Deck 6 junction.
== next.wait.ps
- Power safety: meet the Chief at the Deck 6 port junction. You only watch.
// the Tier 3 test row's own ladder name (t3) and What's next for it
== works.mech.t3
- Your Tier 3 test job
== next.t3
- Next: your Tier 3 test. Relied on, and Power safety, and the Chief puts you up.
== next.wait.t3
- Your Tier 3 test is set. The job board, the Works bay, 09:00.
